            "content": "The trading plan provides for the sale of an aggregate of 10,968 shares of our Class A common stock and all shares received during the duration of the plan pursuant to Ms. Newstead's outstanding equity awards and any future equity award grants, excluding any shares withheld by the company to satisfy its income tax withholding and remittance obligations in connection with the net settlement of the equity awards. The plan will terminate on May 13, 2025, subject to early termination for certain specified events set forth in the plan.",
